<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>As half Johnny\'92s team consulted their tablets for pet shops, a junior tech was in the test room, charged with returning the disc to its containment crate. Having silently eavesdropped on the more senior members of the team and realising the project could be quickly terminated if they didn\'92t get results soon, he found himself taking his frustration out on the disc itself. He  shrugged a 
\f2\i Who cares? 
