<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>It took clinicians twenty minutes to surgically remove the disc. It survived; the junior did not.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Johnny was relieved they\'92d finally learned something about the disc. They\'92d have to get kinetic on its ass.
